    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go\" sounds a lot easier said than done. it feels less like \"letting go of the past\" and more like the universe is just closing doors on me. if everything is just heading toward collapse anyway, what's actually the point of even trying to fight it? it feels like i'm just prolonging the inevitable.",
